      "writtenOn": "2021-05-24T09:38:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is SHA-512 actually tied to AES-CTR such that it makes no sense to support SHA-512 without also supporting SHA-512? If not, might want to use an \"older\" algorithm here (AES-CBC?), so on a hypothetical device that supports SHA-512 but not AES-CTR, we can still test SHA-512.\n\nAlso elsewhere.",
