      "writtenOn": "2021-05-28T01:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SHA-512 is not tied to AES-CTR. We already have 8 tests for AesCbcHmacSha512 (e.g. testAesCbcHmacSha512Tcp4, testAesCbcHmacSha512Tcp4UdpEncap).\n\nThe main purpose here is to test AES-CTR but I don\u0027t think we need to cover all the combinations of AES-CTR and all 7 authentication algorithms so I only choose HmacSha512 here. Thoughts?",
